   <title>Linus Torvalds Working On A Hefty Linux Kernel Improvement With Claude Code</title>
   <link>https://www.phoronix.com/news/Linus-Torvalds-Claude-Code</link>
   <guid>https://www.phoronix.com/news/Linus-Torvalds-Claude-Code</guid>
   <description>Linux creator Linus Torvalds has been known to use AI to help with kernel debugging and outside of the kernel tree has also done some vibe coding with Google's Antigravity. He has previously said he views AI as a useful tool. It turns out he's even now using Claude Code for working on new Linux kern</description>
   <pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 20:16:25 -0400</pubDate>
   </item>
